            new("Check the drive details", "Read the official announcement before registering. Confirm the eligible branches, graduation years, academic conditions, work location and registration deadline. Look for instructions about previous applications, assessment invitations and documents. Save the exact vacancy link and any confirmation number rather than relying only on a forwarded message. If an important condition is ambiguous, use the employer's published contact channel to clarify it. Keep a calendar for registration, assessment and interview dates, with time to prepare the requested material. Treat each drive separately because another employer's selection process may be different."),
            new("Make registration reliable", "Enter your name, education and contact information consistently with your records. Review marks and dates carefully, and do not round or reinterpret values unless the form tells you how. Upload the requested resume version and open the file once to confirm it works. Use an email address you check regularly and watch the spam folder for an expected invitation. Record what you submitted and when. If a portal fails, retain the error details and contact the stated support channel without creating duplicate registrations unnecessarily. Review the instructions again before attempting another submission."),
            new("Prepare for assessments and interviews", "Build your revision plan around the subjects and stages actually named in the announcement. When aptitude or coding is included, practise under a time limit and review why you made mistakes. For technical discussions, prepare a project walkthrough covering the problem, approach, testing and your individual contribution. Rehearse an introduction and examples of teamwork and learning. If the assessment is online, check the device, browser and identification instructions beforehand. Use only the materials and assistance permitted by the assessment rules. Plan enough rest so you can concentrate during the scheduled session."),
