            new("Pack a useful interview folder", "Carry the documents requested in the announcement and organize copies so you can find them quickly. Keep your resume, invitation or registration details and relevant project information together. Follow the employer's instructions about identification and original documents; do not leave originals with an unofficial intermediary. Bring a pen and note the recruiter contact provided for the event. Keep digital copies accessible where appropriate, but avoid sharing sensitive documents in public groups. Prepare water and essential personal items if you expect a long day. Check your folder before leaving home."),
