            new("Prepare a project walkthrough", "Select a project you can explain from the user's problem through implementation and testing. Be ready to describe the main components, how data moves and what happens when something fails. Explain one decision you made, an alternative you considered and a bug you investigated. Make sure any demonstration runs and repository links open. Remove credentials and private information before sharing code. For group projects, identify your contribution clearly and credit others. Honest limitations often lead to a more useful discussion than inflated performance claims. Prepare a brief explanation before showing implementation details."),
