            new("Communicate with professionalism", "Think aloud enough to make your reasoning understandable, but give the interviewer room to ask questions. If feedback points out an error, examine it calmly and correct your approach. Say when you are making an assumption or when you do not know a detail. Avoid dismissing a tool, team or previous implementation without understanding its constraints. In a remote interview, test screen sharing and close private windows before the call. Keep explanations focused on the question and check whether the interviewer would like more technical depth. Listen carefully before defending a decision."),
