            new("Prepare relevant examples", "Choose examples that show accuracy, confidentiality, teamwork and clear explanation. You might discuss how you checked inconsistent figures in a college project, organized records or explained a difficult topic to someone unfamiliar with it. Describe your action and result without claiming banking experience you do not have. For a specialist position, connect your technical work to the requirements stated in the vacancy. Review your resume because an interviewer may ask how you used a listed tool or what you learned from an assignment. Practise answering those questions with specific, truthful details."),
            new("Practise the announced assessments", "If reasoning, numerical skills or language are part of selection, practise those sections with the stated time limits in mind. Analyse mistakes before increasing the number of questions. For an interview, prepare a concise explanation of why the particular role interests you. Read the employer's own description of its services and think about the customers the role supports. Practise scenarios by clarifying the facts, identifying what you can do and explaining when you would seek guidance instead of inventing a procedure. Use preparation materials that match the announced scope of assessment."),
