            new("Demonstrate good working behaviour", "Be punctual, listen closely and take useful notes without interrupting. When you do not understand something, explain what you understood first and then ask a focused question. Show that you can accept feedback by describing how you would revise your approach. Be honest about exams, classes and other commitments affecting attendance. Avoid promising an unrealistic workload just to impress the interviewer. If you discuss previous teams, give credit fairly and focus on what you learned rather than criticizing people or sharing confidential information. Ask for clarification when expectations appear to conflict."),
