            new("Ask about supervision and development", "Ask what a new engineer would work on first, who reviews decisions and what training precedes independent tasks. Clarify the balance between desk work, shop-floor activity and travel. Discuss how the team records changes, checks quality and shares lessons from problems. After the interview, review the fundamentals you struggled to explain and practise with a worked example. If an offer follows, confirm the role, site, schedule and training arrangements in writing so expectations match the work you would undertake. Keep a realistic learning plan for the skills you need to strengthen.")
